    "CBAdvancedTradeGlobalClient.getBlockRfqTrades": "JSON-RPC wrapper for `public/get_block_rfq_trades`, sent as `POST /api/v2`. A public read against the Coinbase gateway on 13 November 2026 returned `Method not found` with `method not in allowlist: public/get_block_rfq_trades`. The method exists in Deribit’s own API, but that does not make it available through Coinbase. Do not rely on this retained wrapper without a current Coinbase support contract.",
